+++ b/NEWS.md
@@ -3,6 +3,18 @@ NEWS
 Shuowen Chen
 9/6/2021
 
+# Development version
+
+- Normalize binomial GLM fitting weights inside `peestimate()`, including
+  classification and subpopulation bootstrap fits. Keep the original weights
+  for weighted quantiles and moments. This avoids numerical failures caused by
+  the bootstrap's 20,000-total quantile weights without changing the weighted
+  likelihood maximizer.
+- Stop when a binomial GLM does not converge, or when classification estimates
+  or bootstrap statistics are non-finite. Invalid draws are no longer silently
+  counted as non-exceedances in joint p-values. Classification moment inference
+  also stops when a bootstrap standard error is zero or non-finite.
+
 # SortedEffects 1.6.0.
 Changes from SortedEffects 1.5.0. The previous version imports a package rlist. Upon receving a warning from CRAN about reverse dependencies, we revise the code so that the package no longer relies on rlist. 
 
